incorrect. The inequality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"a plus b greater than or equals 164\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>164</mn></math> represents a situation where at least <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"164\"><mn>164</mn></math> total bushes will be planted, not that there will be no more than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"164\"><mn>164</mn></math> total bushes planted. Also, the inequality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"3 a greater than or equals b\"><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>b</mi></math> represents a situation where the number of boxwoods that will be planted is at most three times the number of azaleas that will be planted, not that the number of azaleas planted will be at most three times the number of boxwoods planted.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. The inequality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"a plus b greater than or equals 164\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>164</mn></math> represents a situation where at least <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"164\"><mn>164</mn></math> total bushes will be planted, not that there will be no more than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"164\"><mn>164</mn></math> total bushes planted.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. The inequality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"3 a greater than or equals b\"><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>b</mi></math> represents a situation where the number of boxwoods that will be planted is at most three times the number of azaleas that will be planted, not that the number of azaleas planted will be at most three times the number of boxwoods planted.</p>","externalid":"bdad3961-fd1e-41f1-af28-fb816aa8a0b1","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1755117017723,"updateDate":1755117017723}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1755117017723, 1755117017723),
    ($SATQ$6e50ce28$SATQ$, $SATQ$6224ef79-ede3-42e9-82fc-447127d5e27e$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Algebra$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, $SATQ$H.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Systems of two linear equations in two variables$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The sum of a number <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
