als 4 x plus 6\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the equation <math alttext=\"y equals 4 x plus 6\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> defines line <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation defines a line that has a slope of <math alttext=\"negative 6\"><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math>, and passes through the point&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This equation defines a line that has a slope of <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math>, and passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation defines a line that passes through the point&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":nu