</math> packages of party hats, how many cupcakes did she buy?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["41"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["41"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="41"><mn>41</mn>
